WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.566
Welcome to Cloud Minute. Today I'm going to show you how to upgrade

00:00:03.566 --> 00:00:04.966
a free trial to a paid account.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.966
First navigate your browser

00:00:06.966 --> 00:00:09.466
to cloud.google.com/console.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.066
Once logged in you'll see the upgrade banner at the top of the page.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.833
Click upgrade and then click upgrade again.

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:21.700
This will upgrade your free trial to a paid account.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.200
If you want to check your billing information at any time

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.966
you can click billing from the menu.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.566
I hope you found this Cloud Minute helpful.

